  "That code doesn't match the one on the other device.": "Kode hori ez dator bat beste gailukoarekin.",
  "That doesn't look like a URL. Paste an addon link, or one starting with https://": "Horrek ez du URL itxurarik. Itsatsi gehigarri-esteka bat, edo https:// hasten den bat",
  "That file isn't JSON, so it isn't a backup.": "Fitxategi hori ez da JSON, beraz ez da babeskopia.",
